# Accepted findings for the Trivy security scan (see "Security scanning" in
# infra/README.md). Every entry needs a justification.

# No Docker HEALTHCHECK in any of the three Dockerfiles (API, worker, frontend):
# Azure Container Apps ignores Docker HEALTHCHECK and runs its own HTTP probes
# against the ingress port (the enrichment worker isn't even probed — it's a
# drain-and-exit job, not a long-running app), and the API's and worker's
# distroless base images have no shell to run a check command with anyway.
AVD-DS-0026
